WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:01.960
The Scarlet King.

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:06.050
It says something that in a multiverse full
of terrifying, world-ending monsters like

00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:10.760
The Sealed King, the Hanged King - a lot of
Kings, come to think of it - The Crimson Khan

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:13.080
himself overpowers them all.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:18.840
But today we want to pose and hopefully answer
an interesting question: How actually powerful

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:20.930
is The Scarlet King?

00:00:20.930 --> 00:00:24.520
After all, he’s apparently the greatest
threat that the Foundation has ever faced,

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:28.810
we’d be fools to not analyze what we’re
dealing with as an adversary here.

00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:33.030
Despite his exploits being well-documented,
there’s a lot about the Scarlet King’s

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:34.980
personal life we still don’t know.

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:39.450
What’s he doing to pass the time in that
Multiversal Void while awaiting his minions

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.489
to open a portal into our world?

00:00:41.489 --> 00:00:43.080
Does he have friends?

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:44.260
Fulfilling hobbies?

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:46.760
Do you think he watched Sxquid Game, like
the rest of us?

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:48.350
We just don’t know.

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:52.520
Because of these gaps in our knowledge, we’re
taking a pretty wide definition of “power”

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:53.520
here.

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:57.809
We’re not only going to analyze the presumed
abilities of the King himself, but also his

00:00:57.809 --> 00:01:04.260
reputational and institutional power - Including
the abilities of the allies and henchmen in

00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:05.449
his thrall.

00:01:05.449 --> 00:01:09.749
And of course, to keep things balanced, we’re
also going to take a look at his weaknesses,

00:01:09.749 --> 00:01:15.539
both potential and confirmed, to get a bigger
picture of the net power of the Scarlet King.

00:01:15.539 --> 00:01:20.659
So grab your prophetical Daevite tablets and
find a grungy occult warehouse near you - We’re

00:01:20.659 --> 00:01:25.610
gonna find out just how powerful the King
of the Darkness Below really is.

00:01:25.610 --> 00:01:29.349
First thing’s first: What exactly is the
Scarlet King?

00:01:29.349 --> 00:01:34.109
According to the lore given to us by the Dust
and Blood tablet, he’s technically an elder

00:01:34.109 --> 00:01:39.420
God born into a whole race of godlike beings
in the vast abyss below the tree of life.

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:44.179
Already, before he even developed his later
powers, it’s clear this puts the Scarlet

00:01:44.179 --> 00:01:49.669
King into an entirely different weight class
to any human beings, even anomalously enhanced

00:01:49.669 --> 00:01:52.039
ones like Able or Dr. Bright.

00:01:52.039 --> 00:01:56.039
It’s very likely that the Scarlet King’s
very understanding of the concepts of life

00:01:56.039 --> 00:02:00.710
and death differ greatly from what we mere
mortals think about the subject.

00:02:00.710 --> 00:02:05.430
But the Scarlet King isn’t your grandad’s
Elder God: He spent the first eons of his

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:10.789
life becoming the greatest warlord that the
Multiverse has ever known, killing and consuming

00:02:10.789 --> 00:02:16.319
his own siblings in order to amass greater
domination over the darkness below.

00:02:16.319 --> 00:02:21.189
As he slaughtered his way through the ancient
divine hierarchy, he not only expanded his

00:02:21.189 --> 00:02:24.680
territory, he honed his skills as a combatant.

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:30.329
Even against Elder Gods his own size, the
Scarlet King is an almost unstoppable warrior,

00:02:30.329 --> 00:02:35.629
either slaughtering his godly foes or scaring
them so much that they bend the knee to him

00:02:35.629 --> 00:02:38.439
and devote the rest of their lives to service.

00:02:38.439 --> 00:02:43.159
In short, even without any of his allies or
anomalous powers, he’s a true master when

00:02:43.159 --> 00:02:45.390
it comes to one on one combat.

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:49.930
The Scarlet King is also the kind of tyrant
who leads from the front, wanting to get even

00:02:49.930 --> 00:02:53.439
more red on his iconic crimson armor.

00:02:53.439 --> 00:02:57.329
After all, what’s the fun in starting wars
with everyone if you don’t get to bask in

00:02:57.329 --> 00:03:00.549
the glorious thrill of bloodshed and mass
carnage, right?

00:03:00.549 --> 00:03:04.939
The Scarlet King is a big believer in loving
what you do.

00:03:04.939 --> 00:03:08.749
Point is, we’re looking at a warrior king
who can slaughter gods and goddesses with

00:03:08.749 --> 00:03:13.080
his bare hands, and takes great pleasure in
doing so.

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:19.060
To him, humans are unusually intelligent ants,
mocking him with their love of life, peace,

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:22.700
order, and science…Well, for the most part,
anyway.

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:28.689
Physically, he’s astonishingly powerful,
but that still leaves him with certain handicaps.

00:03:28.689 --> 00:03:33.780
For example, his ability to traverse dimensions
is not what he wants it to be.

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:38.280
Thanks to the tireless work of groups like
the SCP Foundation, every single one of his

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:41.359
attempts to physically enter our universe
has failed.

00:03:41.359 --> 00:03:46.609
However, this doesn’t mean that he doesn’t
have the power to at least influence our world,

00:03:46.609 --> 00:03:51.049
even if he hasn’t quite gotten the opportunity
to personally slam dunk planet earth into

00:03:51.049 --> 00:03:52.310
the sun yet.

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:57.360
The Scarlet King, like a lot of eldritch beings
beyond human comprehension, is able to drive

00:03:57.360 --> 00:04:02.880
human beings insane with the mere scope of
his abilities, having easily broken the mind

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:06.810
of Dr. Montauk when he learned of the Scarlet
King’s true nature.

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:11.569
The Scarlet King is also capable of bringing
out the worst in people, projecting his boundless

00:04:11.569 --> 00:04:16.200
desire for cruelty and malice into those vulnerable
to him.

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:21.220
As a truly ancient being, he’s had eons
of experience, and could easily outsmart and

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:26.240
destroy the psyche of any non-anomalous human
being arrogant or foolish enough to try to

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:27.370
face him.

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:33.430
From his SCP-001 file as well as the classified
documents on Procedure 110 Montauk, we also

00:04:33.430 --> 00:04:38.639
know that the Scarlet King is able to perceive
things in our dimension in a limited fashion.

00:04:38.639 --> 00:04:43.270
While he isn’t truly omniscient outside
his own reality like our traditional perception

00:04:43.270 --> 00:04:49.889
of the Abrahamic God, he can sense feelings
and energies, his favorites being hate, cruelty,

00:04:49.889 --> 00:04:50.889
and violence.

00:04:50.889 --> 00:04:55.320
However, this strength can also be used against
him thanks to the Foundation’s knowledge

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:58.229
of how the Scarlet King’s perceptive abilities
work.

00:04:58.229 --> 00:05:03.060
For example, they were able to trick the Scarlet
King into buying their lie about Procedure

00:05:03.060 --> 00:05:08.300
110 Montauk, simply through a massive and
coordinated information campaign that convinced

00:05:08.300 --> 00:05:14.139
a huge number of people that Procedure 110
Montauk actually was a horrifying act of profound

00:05:14.139 --> 00:05:15.759
inhumanity.

00:05:15.759 --> 00:05:20.100
And if it worked once in this fashion, it
could be used to shield other things from

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:25.000
the Scarlet King’s knowledge, creating a
huge weakness for this would-be conqueror.

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:28.910
However, the Scarlet King doesn’t need to
wage his evil war alone.

00:05:28.910 --> 00:05:32.060
He is, after all, the Scarlet King.

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:37.710
An evil monarch whose reign brings darkness
and barbarism, and as such, he’s indivisible

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:41.470
from the forces who help him carry out his
depraved goals.

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:46.490
This segues nicely into our next question
about the power level of the Scarlet King:

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:49.599
What exactly are his supposed armies?

00:05:49.599 --> 00:05:51.310
Who are his boots on the ground?

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:54.669
We’ll start with human and human-adjacent.

00:05:54.669 --> 00:05:58.199
Probably the most common of the groups that
the Foundation are forced to counter are Scarlet

00:05:58.199 --> 00:06:03.060
King Cultists, such as members of groups like
the Children of the Scarlet King.

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:07.560
They may not be the largest group of interest,
or the most trained or well-funded, but they

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:12.500
have one thing over all the other GOIs: Truly
boundless depravity.

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:17.590
If you take a look over the full file for
SCP-231, not only will you feel like you need

00:06:17.590 --> 00:06:22.020
a shower, you’ll also realize that there
isn’t anything these hooded monsters wouldn’t

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:24.889
do in service of their dark master.

00:06:24.889 --> 00:06:28.830
Kidnapping and murder are the two more mild
crimes.

00:06:28.830 --> 00:06:33.470
Like with most dangerous cults, the Scarlet
King’s followers are heavily decentralized

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:37.479
and may have nothing that easily pegs them
as his devotees.

00:06:37.479 --> 00:06:42.479
The fact that he has human eyes and ears hidden
everywhere is an undeniable feather in the

00:06:42.479 --> 00:06:44.210
King’s bloody crown.

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:49.200
But these non-anomalous cultists only amount
to a fraction of the King’s earthly forces.

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:53.490
He’s had human armies and civilizations
pledge allegiance to his cause over the course

00:06:53.490 --> 00:06:54.490
of history.

00:06:54.490 --> 00:07:00.159
Take, for example, SCP-3838 - The Nomads of
the 4th Dimensional Steppe.

00:07:00.159 --> 00:07:05.250
These tribes of Turkmen Warriors exist in
the exact same place at vastly different points

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:09.360
in time, traveling via a mysterious ritual
and a magical yurt.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:14.380
At least one of these tribes worship the Scarlet
King and have a vested interest in his rule

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:16.360
over all things.

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:20.500
But of course, no section about the armies
of the Scarlet King would be complete without

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:25.500
his biggest fans: A little extinct culture
known as the Daevites.

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:31.870
Well, extinct for now at least, because SCP-140
- An Incomplete Chronicle - always leaves

00:07:31.870 --> 00:07:35.310
the possibility of their return as an open
question.

00:07:35.310 --> 00:07:38.720
So who exactly were these ancient conquerors?

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:43.150
Just in case you’ve repressed the memory,
the Daevites were an entire society of hyper-violent

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:49.580
monsters that loved to use imperialism, slavery,
and subjugation to get whatever they wanted,

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:51.860
and killed all who defied them.

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:56.220
Think of them like the British Empire, with
more magic and less tea.

00:07:56.220 --> 00:08:00.780
They based their entire civilizational philosophy
on the teachings and lifestyle of the Scarlet

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:08.099
King, which is to say: Absolute primal brutality
rules, and he who can stomp on everyone else

00:08:08.099 --> 00:08:09.479
is the leader.

00:08:09.479 --> 00:08:13.219
And of course, nobody stomps harder than the
Scarlet King.

00:08:13.219 --> 00:08:18.909
If ever SCP-140 was exposed to too much ink
or blood, the Daevites would wind up ruling

00:08:18.909 --> 00:08:24.389
the modern world, and in all likelihood, they’d
do it in the name of the Scarlet King.

00:08:24.389 --> 00:08:28.009
But those are only his human and human-adjacent
servants.

00:08:28.009 --> 00:08:32.200
For starters, he’s also got a legion of
conquered elder gods who’ve pledged fealty

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:37.430
to him, and are now some of the most loyal
warriors for their brutal tyrant of a boss.

00:08:37.430 --> 00:08:43.260
However, even a legion of elder gods is nothing
compared to the Scarlet King’s generals:

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:45.260
Six of his seven daughters.

00:08:45.260 --> 00:08:49.830
Funny, even the most evil nightmare being
ever conceived indulges in a little nepotism

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:51.040
here and there.

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:56.310
Though in his defense, it isn’t easy being
a single father - admittedly, that’s only

00:08:56.310 --> 00:09:00.920
because he crushed their mother, the kind
goddess Sanna, to death in cold blood.

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:05.150
Each one of his daughters gives him access
to new armies and powers.

00:09:05.150 --> 00:09:10.260
The golden child, A’tivik, brings tactical
brilliance and advanced knowledge of all things

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:14.090
warfare, with children who are equally well-versed
in the combat arts.

00:09:14.090 --> 00:09:19.120
Then there’s A’ghor, who makes up for
what she lacks in quality with sheer, insane

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:20.470
quantity.

00:09:20.470 --> 00:09:24.760
Her children have produced obscenely large
armies that can overwhelm their foes like

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:30.180
living tides of hatred and murder, all of
which are loyal to the Scarlet King himself.

00:09:30.180 --> 00:09:36.050
Next, A’distat, a desolate daughter as mean
and hateful as her dear old dad.

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:40.440
Her armies charge forth, declaring victory
in the name of the King.

00:09:40.440 --> 00:09:45.190
They also have the ability to spread devastating
pestilence with their mere presence, making

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:51.090
other armies deathly ill and probably making
SCP-049 feel extremely anxious.

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:56.310
He’s also got A’zieb, probably his biggest,
scariest daughter that appears in the form

00:09:56.310 --> 00:09:58.800
of a giant, unstoppable beast.

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:03.670
Her armies are also bestial nightmares, and
she herself seems impossible to harm with

00:10:03.670 --> 00:10:05.070
any mortal weapon.

00:10:05.070 --> 00:10:09.850
There’s A’nuht, the Scarlet King’s frailest
daughter, but a natural when it comes to all

00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:11.460
things magic.

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:16.470
She and her reality-warping children are actually
so powerful that the Scarlet King himself

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:20.810
felt a little threatened by them, and had
them all physically disabled.

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:26.930
Now, the Scarlet King has unfettered access
to powerful thaumaturgy at his disposal.

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:33.250
And then there’s A’tellif, his most mysterious
daughter who prides herself on privacy and

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:38.340
is, accordingly, a master in the art of stealth,
with her and her children having the ability

00:10:38.340 --> 00:10:42.820
to change their faces and walk among people
unnoticed.

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:47.770
With such absurdly huge armies, a large number
of emissaries in our world, and six daughters

00:10:47.770 --> 00:10:53.480
who grant him obscene and varied powers, it’s
clear that the Scarlet King truly is the most

00:10:53.480 --> 00:10:57.360
powerful enemy that the SCP Foundation has
ever faced.

00:10:57.360 --> 00:11:03.370
However, his most major weakness is his seventh
daughter and her offspring: A’habbat, the

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:08.070
child of hope, and the only daughter strong
in spirit enough to fight back against her

00:11:08.070 --> 00:11:09.640
monstrous father.

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:15.390
Her children are great heroes, and one of
them is believed to be SCP-999, the Tickle

00:11:15.390 --> 00:11:16.390
Monster.

00:11:16.390 --> 00:11:20.320
The Scarlet King may have sown the seeds of
his own destruction, as it’s prophesied

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:26.200
that if SCP-999 is nurtured and continues
to grow, he may one day become strong enough

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:30.370
to defeat the Scarlet King’s evil with his
sheer force of good.

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:34.760
With all of these Scarlet King strengths,
powers, allies, and weaknesses I think we

00:11:34.760 --> 00:11:40.300
can confidently answer the question: How actually
powerful is the Scarlet King?

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:46.390
To put it simply, he’s extremely powerful,
perhaps more powerful than anything else out

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:47.390
there.

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:49.540
But he’s still not invincible.

00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:53.800
The next question is whether the Foundation
can identify the cracks in the Scarlet King’s

00:11:53.800 --> 00:12:00.140
bloodstained armor before he enters our world,
and annihilates everything we know and love…

00:12:00.140 --> 00:12:06.600
Now go check out “Children of SCP-001 The
Scarlet King - Is SCP-999 Really His Son?”

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:12.140
and “SCP-001- Scarlet King - Dust and Blood”
for more insider information on the first

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:14.730
word in pure, undiluted evil!

